27:T43e,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you take us from Al Khobar to Half Moon Bay and back?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Book it as a round trip with a pickup time for the return, or keep the car for the day if you have more than one stop. The fare is agreed before booking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we go straight from DMM Airport to a Half Moon Bay resort?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Give us the flight number and the resort name; we track the flight, meet you at arrivals and drive you to the resort."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you arrange the resort or chalet booking?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No — that is booked directly with the resort. We provide the private transport there and back."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which car for a family beach day?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A GMC Yukon XL or a van such as the Hyundai Staria gives room for beach gear and children; the car is confirmed for your date when we quote."}}]}1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C]","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TaxiService\",\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/locations/dammam/half-moon-bay#service\",\"name\":\"Private Car to Half Moon Bay\",\"serviceType\":\"Private transfer service\",\"description\":\"Private car to Half Moon Bay beach and resorts — from Al Khobar, Dammam, Dhahran or DMM Airport, with a timed return or a driver who waits. Fare agreed first.\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/locations/dammam/half-moon-bay\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Taxi Saudi Arabia\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Dammam\"},\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\",\"Arabic\"],\"about\":{\"@type\":\"TouristAttraction